OL,3,GNEWSASenior PSNI officer arrested over
OL,4,Aalleged sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior police officer has been
OL,7,Farrested and questioned over an
OL,8,Fallegation of sexual assault.
OL,10,FHe was detained in Belfast on Monday,
OL,11,Ffollowing a complaint made by a woman.
OL,13,FIn a statement, the Police Service of
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) said: "A
OL,15,F47-year-old male was arrested on Monday
OL,16,F16 November on suspicion of sexual
OL,17,Fassault, following a report of an
OL,18,Fincident that is alleged to have
OL,19,Foccurred at an address in east Belfast
OL,20,Fon Sunday 15 November.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
